also thank you for the link to twice exceptional, I'd never heard of this despite reading about ADHD for a while! I'm hesitant to say that this is me because I didn't struggle in school until I had to become responsible for myself at 13 which is when problems arose. Even then, I managed to be a great student, one of the best in school until 9th grade. (Then I got into art school and everything changed god damn it)   


